4510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "What does Dr Hussain say is difficult when treating patients who are not\nin hospital?\n(A) They often find the exercises too complicated.\n(B) They tend to have difficulty socialising with other people.\n(C) They don’t always understand the importance of their\ntreatment.", "sourcePage": 19, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "What does Dr Hussein say about the role of ‘distraction therapy’ in\ncystic fibrosis treatment?\n(A) It can be related to the treatment being provided.\n(B) It allows patients to complete their activities more quickly.\n(C) It provides staff with more information about the patient’s\ncondition.", "sourcePage": 20, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "What changes did Dr Hussein observe in one of her patients?\n(A) He showed respiratory improvement.\n(B) He deteriorated rapidly following a change in treatment.\n(C) He began to enjoy aspects of their treatment.", "sourcePage": 20, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Dr Hussein plans to use technology to help cystic fibrosis patients to\ncommunicate\n(A) with other patients who suffer from the condition.\n(B) with family members who cannot visit them in hospital.\n(C) with patients of a similar age suffering from different\nconditions.", "sourcePage": 20, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "Dr Hussein suggests that future treatments for cystic fibrosis\n(A) will always incorporate lengthy procedures.\n(B) could prevent breathing difficulties in sufferers.\n(C) might be less painful than the current options available.", "sourcePage": 20, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["60d0ad8684380d47461d992fcdb3fd09f84dc67b657465bbc26543aa1e470f99"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
